      "author": {
        "id": 5707
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-11-02T11:48:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this is just so that for installations that user an all LDAP configuration, they don\u0027t need to specific the driver type for resource (and assignment) explicitly.  This method is only referenced from the init of resources/core.py. It is provided for backward compatibility only.",
      "parentUuid": "7a8c0949_2adefa3f",
      "revId": "3f6031375c1e384b5052c1f8b5deeb32f7f490ad",
